红兵五进一，卒5进1，车六进五之着。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":24,"anchor_node_id":"0:24","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment25:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment25","raw_text":"    红进车好着，以后有兵三进一、马一进二两种进攻着法，为攻击黑方左翼创造了条件。","text":"    红进车好着，以后有兵三进一、马一进二两种进攻着法，为攻击黑方左翼创造了条件。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":25,"anchor_node_id":"0:25","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment40:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment40","raw_text":"    红经运调子力，将黑大部分子力赶至右翼背处，现平车让开马道，准备马二进四攻黑空虚的左翼，着法含蓄有力。黑跃起边马并不能阻止红马二进四的攻势，似应车2进4顶住较好。","text":"    红经运调子力，将黑大部分子力赶至右翼背处，现平车让开马道，准备马二进四攻黑空虚的左翼，着法含蓄有力。黑跃起边马并不能阻止红马二进四的攻势，似应车2进4顶住较好。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":40,"anchor_node_id":"0:40","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment44:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment44","raw_text":"    红冲中兵，黑已难挡红大军压境的攻势。黑如车4平5，则马七进五，红亦得子。","text":"    红冲中兵，黑已难挡红大军压境的攻势。黑如车4平5，则马七进五，红亦得子。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":44,"anchor_node_id":"0:44","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment47:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment47","raw_text":"    红胜。||    ||","text":"    红胜。\n    \n","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":47,"anchor_node_id":"0:47","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false}],"issues":[],"metadata":{"DhtmlXQ_init":["500,350"],"DhtmlXQ_title":["第四章 进兵局 阎文清 胜 陈启明"],"DhtmlXQ_event":["第四章 进兵局(8局)"],"DhtmlXQ_open":["E47 对兵转兵底炮对右中炮"],"DhtmlXQ_remark":[""],"DhtmlXQ_author":[""],"DhtmlXQ_binit":["0919293949596979891777062646668600102030405060708012720323436383"]},"source_tag_count":14,"identical_tag_duplicates":0,"binit":"0919293949596979891777062646668600102030405060708012720323436383","side_to_move":"w","side_basis":"color of first source mover at binit square","standard_start":true,"summary":{"lines":1,"structured_branches":0,"line_statuses":{"legal":1},"source_move_records":47,"legal_move_records":47,"annotations":6,"annotation_statuses":{"attached":6}},"memberships":[{"boo